# Skill stack (whitelist only)

Read matching `SKILL.md` from disk **before** implementing. Use **only** skills listed here — do not pull from the full MengTo library (Three.js, ARPG, landing pages, Tailwind demos).

## Always read first (game core)

| Skill | Path | Use for |
|-------|------|---------|
| hookah-game-design | `~/.cursor/skills/hookah-game-design/SKILL.md` | Theme, Russian copy, zones, staff names |
| browser-idle-tycoon | `~/.cursor/skills/browser-idle-tycoon/SKILL.md` | Economy, upgrades, managers, prestige, save |
| web-game-scaffold | `~/.cursor/skills/web-game-scaffold/SKILL.md` | Vite, mobile, deploy |

