## Task → repo paths

| Feature | Start in |
|---------|----------|
| Balance, tasks, ranks | `src/game/`, `src/data/` |
| Shell, panels, FAB | `src/ui/shell.ts`, `src/styles/main.css` |
| Boot, contract, venue | `src/ui/boot.ts`, `bootScreens.ts`, `mascot.ts` |
| Coach / Огонёк | `src/ui/guideOverlay.ts`, `src/game/guide.ts` |
| Juice | `src/ui/juice.ts` |
| Lounge stage | `src/ui/loungeStage.ts` |
| Save | `src/save/storage.ts` |

## Conventions

- Stack: Vite + TS + vanilla DOM — no React, Phaser, or Three.js unless user asks
- Particles/backgrounds: canvas or CSS only; pause offscreen (`optimize-web-animations`)
- UI: Russian; mascot **Огонёк**
- Minimal diffs; match surrounding code

Missing skills: `./scripts/install-lounge-skills.sh`
